{"id":"667adfc185705458f91f8d75e82d1185d0132610","axis":"silent","repo":"symfony/symfony","sha":"667adfc185705458f91f8d75e82d1185d0132610","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"src/Symfony/Component/HtmlSanitizer/Tests/HtmlSanitizerCustomTest.php","lines":["@@ -576,6 +576,82 @@ public function testMetaRefreshContentIsSanitized()","         );","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * @dataProvider provideMetaRefreshContent","+     */","+    public function testMetaRefreshContentGrammar(string $content, string $expected)","+    {","+        $config = (new HtmlSanitizerConfig())","+            ->allowStaticElements()","+            ->allowLinkHosts(['trusted.example'])","+        ;","+","+        $this->assertSame(","+            $expected,","+            (new HtmlSanitizer($config))->sanitizeFor('head', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"'.$content.'\">')","+        );","+    }","+","+    public static function provideMetaRefreshContent(): iterable","+    {","+        yield 'canonical' => ['0;url=https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'whitespace separator' => ['0 url=https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'no url keyword' => ['0;https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'whitespace around comma' => ['9 , https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'comma separator' => ['0,https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'fractional time' => ['.5;url=https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'incomplete url keyword' => ['0;uhttps://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'quoted url' => ['0;url=&#039;https://evil.example/&#039;', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'unparsable directive' => ['0:https://evil.example/', '<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" />'];","+        yield 'vertical tab in the url keyword' => [\"0;url\\x0B=https://tru